---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Independent Observer contact information and future correspondence plans."
  currentPath="/contact/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Contact"
    title="Contact is not open yet."
    description="Independent Observer has only recently begun taking shape. There is no public email address, intake form, or active correspondence channel; future contact arrangements will be considered as the research and the author's wider plans develop."
  />
  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="shell page-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Not available for contact</h2>
        <p>
          This project is at an early stage. Questions, corrections, and disagreements may become
          part of a future public discussion, but this site is not currently accepting messages or
          promising a response.
        </p>
        <h3>About the author</h3>
        <p>
          Siddhartha Harsh Wardhan is building Independent Observer as a public home for
          evidence-led research, documentary work, and cross-disciplinary explanation. The project
          begins with observation, documentation, and visible limits rather than a finished
          publication program.
        </p>
        <h3>Future direction</h3>
        <p>
          The author is considering a future social-media company alongside this research work. That
          possibility is not an active company, service, or launch announcement from this page.
        </p>
        <h3>When this changes</h3>
        <p>
          A public contact route may be added later, after the project's publication and privacy
          arrangements are ready. Until then, the absence of a contact channel is deliberate.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="contact-panel contact-panel-closed" aria-labelledby="contact-closed-title">
        <p class="contact-panel-kicker">Not accepting messages</p>
        <h2 id="contact-closed-title">The correspondence door is closed for now.</h2>
        <p>
          No email address or message form is active. Nothing submitted here is collected, stored,
          or forwarded.
        </p>
        <div class="contact-panel-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="contact-panel-note">
          Future discussion may include corrections, public records, documentary inquiries, rights,
          and professional correspondence—but only after a clear privacy policy and response process
          are in place.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
